      "split": "pending_alignment",
      "category": "intra_document_multichunk",
      "question": "P01 的目标岗位与项目做法是什么，已表现出的能力和仍需验证的风险又分别是什么？",
      "answerable": true,
      "expectedChunkRefs": [],
